    "Wait is best in 24/27 cost cells including frozen original 150/18/.06 weights.",
    "SG055 wins three scenarios where error penalty is halved and abstention penalty doubled; SG054 never wins any grid cell.",
    "SG055 gains 31 correct outcomes and reduces unresolved by 52 vs wait but adds 21 wrong directions; this accounts for its baseline loss regression.",
    "Training-derived action ranking is not invariant to decision costs; no single decision policy is universally optimal without defining stakes."
  ],
